<title>USA: US Medical to get ISO 9001 certification.</title>
<headline>US Medical to get ISO 9001 certification.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>US Medical Products Inc said on Monday it expected to receive certificates for ISO 9001, EN 46001 and Medical Device Directive Annex II and Annex V in December.</p>
<p>The company said it would begin to distribute CE marked products in January 1997.</p>
